{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Ridgeline Markets API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Events and odds for the sportsbook. Read-only.\n\nRead-only catalog of **events** and **markets with odds**. Use it to build a bet slip and to find the `market_id` / `outcome_id` that bets and promotions need.\n\n**Owner:** Team Trading · **Consumers:** bet-slip, sportsbook-app, promotions tooling\n\nThe sandbox has one event, `EVT-FINAL-2026` (Championship Final: Harbor Hawks vs. Summit Bears), with a moneyline (`MKT-ML-001`) and a total (`MKT-TOT-001`).\n\n## Authentication\n\nSend `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. **Each API has its own key**, and a key for one API is rejected by the others.\n\nKeys are never handed out directly. Request access and you receive a **credential reference** such as `{{vault:RIDGELINE_BETS_KEY}}`. A secure access proxy (Postman Passport) swaps the reference for the real key at call time, so neither your code, your agent nor its logs ever hold the secret.\n\n| Response | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `401 unauthorized` | Missing key, or a key for a different API |\n| `401 unresolved_reference` | A `{{vault:...}}` reference reached the API unresolved: the call skipped the proxy |\n\n\n## Conventions\n\n- **Base URL:** `https://<host>/<api>`, e.g. `https://<host>/bets/v1/bets`. Paths are exact (no path parameters), so access grants can match method + host + path.\n- **Money:** every amount is an **integer in minor units (cents)**. `1000` = $10.00. Decimals are rejected.\n- **Products:** `sportsbook` or `casino`.\n- **Players:** sandbox players `P-1001` to `P-1005` (see each API's notes).\n- **Errors:** JSON `{ \"error\": \"<code>\", \"message\": \"<human readable>\" }`, plus extra fields where noted.\n- **Idempotency:** write endpoints that move value take an `idempotency_key` or are naturally idempotent (claims).\n\n*Ridgeline is a fictional company; all data is sandbox data.*",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Team Trading"
    },
    "x-owner": "Team Trading"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{host}/markets",
      "description": "Hosted sandbox (route through Passport)",
      "variables": {
        "host": {
          "default": "your-project.vercel.app"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:4100/markets",
      "description": "Local (next dev)"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "markets",
      "description": "Events and odds for the sportsbook. Read-only. Owner: Team Trading."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/events": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "markets"
        ],
        "operationId": "markets_get_events",
        "summary": "List events",
        "description": "List upcoming events.",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "events": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "events": [
                    {
                      "event_id": "EVT-FINAL-2026",
                      "name": "Championship Final: Harbor Hawks vs. Summit Bears",
                      "starts_at": "2026-10-25T00:30:00Z",
                      "league": "Sandbox League"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request: missing fields, invalid JSON or invalid values.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "missing_fields",
                  "message": "Missing required field(s): player_id.",
                  "fields": [
                    "player_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/markets": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "markets"
        ],
        "operationId": "markets_get_markets",
        "summary": "List markets with odds for an event",
        "description": "List markets with their outcomes and odds. Filter with `event_id`. American and decimal odds are both returned. Use `decimal_odds` for payout math (`payout = stake × decimal_odds`). An unknown `event_id` returns an empty list, not an error.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "event_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Filter by event.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "EVT-FINAL-2026"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "markets": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "markets": [
                    {
                      "market_id": "MKT-ML-001",
                      "event_id": "EVT-FINAL-2026",
                      "type": "moneyline",
                      "name": "Moneyline",
                      "outcomes": [
                        {
                          "outcome_id": "OUT-HAWKS",
                          "name": "Harbor Hawks",
                          "american_odds": -130,
                          "decimal_odds": 1.77
                        },
                        {
                          "outcome_id": "OUT-BEARS",
                          "name": "Summit Bears",
                          "american_odds": 110,
                          "decimal_odds": 2.1
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "market_id": "MKT-TOT-001",
                      "event_id": "EVT-FINAL-2026",
                      "type": "total",
                      "name": "Total Points 47.5",
                      "outcomes": [
                        {
                          "outcome_id": "OUT-OVER",
                          "name": "Over 47.5",
                          "american_odds": -110,
                          "decimal_odds": 1.91
                        },
                        {
                          "outcome_id": "OUT-UNDER",
                          "name": "Under 47.5",
                          "american_odds": -110,
                          "decimal_odds": 1.91
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request: missing fields, invalid JSON or invalid values.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "missing_fields",
                  "message": "Missing required field(s): player_id.",
                  "fields": [
                    "player_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Use the Passport reference {{vault:RIDGELINE_MARKETS_KEY}}. Never a raw key."
      }
    }
  }
}
